10,87,66)>{Runes gain:}}}\r\n<rgb(135,134,253)>{Empowered}","Ruin is gained if you are hit by a Stalking Shade inside the Trial of Chaos.\r\n\r\nFail the Trials on reaching 7 Ruin","Abyssal Fissures are a group of areas which contain [ContainsAbyss|Abysses]. \r\n\r\nThese Abysses are always of a single faction, with the final area leading to that faction's boss. Abyssal monsters become stronger and more frequent further along the Fissure.","[AzmeriSpirit|Azmeri Spirits] can be released from various [SpiritPossessed|Possessed] monsters.\r\n\r\nReleased Spirits have a chance to manifest into the world with a portion of the empowerment the monster was possessed with. \r\n\r\nReleased Spirits have 1% chance to manifest per 2% empowerment. This empowerment is shared with each Spirit released, and the Released Spirit has half of this empowerment once released.","Vaal Relics are found within Frigid Bluffs [GrandExpedition|Grand Expeditions] and as a modifier on [ExpeditionAugment|Expedition Tablets].\r\n\r\nThese Relics can be unearthed, similar to [ContainsExpedition2|Verisium Remnants] and add their modifiers to anything excavated with the explosive that destroys the Relic and any excavated with future explosives in the chain.\r\n\r\nUnlike Verisium Remnants, Vaal Relics have predefined modifiers that cannot be modified.","Rune","Soul Core","Idol","Abyssal Eye","Congealed Mist","#% increased Life and Mana Recovery from [Flask|Flasks]","#% increased [Pinned|Pin] duration","Recover #% of maximum Mana on Kill","[Attack|Attacks] with this Weapon Penetrate #% Elemental Resistances","#% reduced Effect of [NonDamagingAilments|Non-Damaging Ailments] on you","[StatConversion|Convert] #% of Requirements to [Strength|Strength]","[StatConversion|Convert] #% of Requirements to [Dexterity|Dexterity]","[StatConversion|Convert] #% of Requirements to [Intelligence|Intelligence]","[Minion|Minions] gain #% of their [Physical] Damage as Extra [Lightning] Damage","Minions take #% of [Physica